  '<div class="callout blue" style="margin-bottom:17px">The complete topic tracker is available here. Current authored question bank and detailed learning guides are focused on Equity because the supplied notes and question set cover Equity Valuation.</div>'+
  '<div class="grid grid-3 subject-grid">'+TOPIC_AREAS.map(renderSubjectCard).join('')+'</div>';
